  "title": "Audit/finding channel evidence-state discipline and manual archival entry",
  "description": "让 koala 的 audit/finding 通道继承 bug 通道的证据纪律：给 finding 加 suspected / verified / disproven 证据状态模型，未复现或无源码证据的 finding 不能呈现成 confirmed bug；并补一个不依赖 reviewer / review round 的手动归档入口，让人工发现的框架 gap 能干净进 audit backlog。",
